# MODULE bounded general PC BF in BF with integrated complete source preflight
# PURPOSE reject every malformed loaded source before any guest instruction runs
# INPUT one unsigned length byte source bytes then a one byte guest fuel and stdin
# OUTPUT guest bytes then one terminal status byte with no bytes on preflight failure
# TAPE original program source cells start at sixty four and controls end at twenty one
# TAPE lexical preflight temporarily uses reserved high scratch cells above five hundred
# PROFILE preflight scans complete loaded source before the fuel read or any guest effects
# PROFILE illegal bytes win before unmatched close then unmatched open bracket errors
# PROFILE original pointer tape and guest fuel execution code are unchanged
# LIMITATION diagnostic source limit one hundred twenty seven commands and sixteen cells
# LIMITATION this does not authenticate trailing host bytes or physical stream closure
# LIMITATION no original source byte offset is yet provided in the terminal diagnostic
# SAFETY intended only for complete declared input with verified physical host completion

# Original source loader retained byte for byte
